              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.difgeo.2022.101969"}> doi:10.1016/j.difgeo.2022.101969
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On this approach seen in the broader context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+homotopy+theory"} cohesive
