                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.15887"}> arXiv:2205.15887
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %h3#orbifold_cobordism Orbifold cobordism
          %p
            Orbifold
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordisms"} cobordisms
            are discussed in
          %ul
