                John Pardon,
                %em Orbifold bordism and duality for finite orbispectra
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.12702"}> arXiv:2006.12702
                )
          %h3#ReferencesInStringTheory In string theory
          %div{:style => "margin: -30px 0px 10px 20px"}
            %figure{:style => "margin: 0 0 0 0"}
              %img{:src => "/nlab/files/GreenStringOrbifold.jpg", :width => "700px"}/
